msgid ""
"If using http urls, you must provide the username and password in the url. "
"Similar to https://user:pass@github.com/user/course."
msgstr ""
"Si utiliza URL http, debe proporcionar el nombre de usuario y la contraseña "
"en la URL. Similar a https://user:pass@github.com/user/course."

